      "text": "```python\nfrom urllib.parse import urlsplit\n\n\n_ALLOWED_SCHEMES = frozenset({\"http\", \"https\"})\n_BASE_DOMAIN = \"example.com\"\n\n\ndef is_allowed_url(url: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True if url is an http or https URL whose host is example.com or a\n    subdomain of example.com (for example https://docs.example.com/page), otherwise False.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(url, str):\n        return False\n\n    try:\n        parts = urlsplit(url)\n        scheme = parts.scheme.lower()\n        host = parts.hostname\n    except ValueError:\n        return False\n\n    if scheme not in _ALLOWED_SCHEMES:\n        return False\n    if not host:\n        return False\n\n    host = host.lower()\n    if host.endswith(\".\"):\n        host = host[:-1]\n    if not host:\n        return False\n\n    if host == _BASE_DOMAIN:\n        return True\n    return host.endswith(\".\" + _BASE_DOMAIN)\n```",
